msgid "Expiry has been reminded"
msgstr "已提醒過期"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_category__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "識別號"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_trace
msgid "Lot/Serial Number"
msgstr "批次/序號"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__expiration_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__expiration_time
msgid ""
"Number of days after the receipt of the products (from the vendor or in "
"stock after production) after which the goods may become dangerous and must "
"not be consumed. It will be computed on the lot/serial number."
msgstr "收到產品（來自供應商或生產後的庫存）後，貨物可能變得危險且不得食用的天數。它將根據批次/序號計算。"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__alert_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__alert_time
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which an alert should be "
"raised on the lot/serial number. It will be computed on the lot/serial "
"number."
msgstr "到期日之前的天數，之後應在批次/序號上發出警報。它將根據批次/序號計算。"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__removal_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__removal_time
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which the goods should be "
"removed from the stock and not be counted in the Fresh On Hand Stock "
"anymore.It will be computed on the lot/serial number."
msgstr ""

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__use_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__use_time
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which the goods starts "
"deteriorating, without being dangerous yet. It will be computed on the "
"lot/serial number."
msgstr "在到期日之前，貨物開始變質但尚未危險的天數。它將根據批次/序號計算。"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_template
msgid "Product"
msgstr "商品"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_category
msgid "Product Category"
msgstr "產品分類"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__product_expiry_alert
msgid "Product Expiry Alert"
msgstr "產品過期警告"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_product
msgid "Product Variant"
msgstr "產品款式"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_trace_expiry/models/product_template.py:0
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__removal_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__removal_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__removal_date
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_trace_expiry.view_product_trace_form
msgid "Removal Date"
msgstr "下架日期"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__product_expiry_alert
msgid "The Expiration Date has been reached."
msgstr "已到到期日。"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_trace_expiry/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The expiry delays of %(product)s are numbers of days and cannot be negative:"
" %(fields)s. A negative delay puts a lot's removal date after its expiration"
" date, which leaves expired goods reservable and blocks the transfer that "
"would clear them."
msgstr ""

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__expiration_date
msgid ""
"This is the date on which the goods with this Serial Number may become "
"dangerous and must not be consumed."
msgstr "此處表明該序列號的商品變得危險的日期，此時該商品不能使用。"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__removal_date
msgid ""
"This is the date on which the goods with this Serial Number should be "
"removed from the stock and not be counted in the Fresh On Hand Stock "
"anymore. This date will be used in FEFO removal strategy."
msgstr ""

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__use_date
msgid ""
"This is the date on which the goods with this Serial Number start "
"deteriorating, without being dangerous yet."
msgstr "此處表明該序列號的商品開始變質的日期（未變危險）。"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_category__use_expiration_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__use_expiration_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__use_expiration_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__use_expiration_date
msgid "Use Expiration Date"
msgstr "使用到期日"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_category__use_expiration_date
msgid ""
"When this box is ticked, products in this category default to managing "
"product expiration, with dates on the product and on the corresponding "
"lot/serial numbers"
msgstr ""

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__use_expiration_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__use_expiration_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_trace__use_expiration_date
msgid ""
"When this box is ticked, you have the possibility to specify dates to manage"
" product expiration, on the product and on the corresponding lot/serial "
"numbers. Defaults to the product category setting."
msgstr ""
